⨯ union-key: union variant 'red_value' cannot use @key
  @ test.idl:10:6

  8 │ union ColorData switch(Color) {
  9 │ case RED:
 10 │     @key long red_value;
    │      ˆˆˆ @key not allowed on union variant
 11 │ case GREEN:
 12 │     @key long green_value;

  ? remove @key from the variant or move it to the discriminator
  * only the union discriminator can be marked as @key

⨯ union-key: union variant 'green_value' cannot use @key
  @ test.idl:12:6

 10 │     @key long red_value;
 11 │ case GREEN:
 12 │     @key long green_value;
    │      ˆˆˆ @key not allowed on union variant
 13 │ case BLUE:
 14 │     long blue_value;  // OK - no @key

  ? remove @key from the variant or move it to the discriminator
  * only the union discriminator can be marked as @key
